#label>\t\"whole numbers only\"\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#wholeNumbersOnly>\t<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain>\t<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#Game>\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#wholeNumbersOnly>\t<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type>\t<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty>\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#defaultStaminaCost>\t<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment>\t\"What this game charges for a swing when the item never said.\"\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#defaultStaminaCost>\t<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label>\t\"default stamina cost\"\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#defaultStaminaCost>\t<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain>\t<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#Game>\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#defaultStaminaCost>\t<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type>\t<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty>\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#damageReductionAtMaxArmour>\t<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment>\t\"Fraction of incoming damage removed at the top of the armour scale. With the max rating this fixes the scale as linear.\"\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#damageReductionAtMaxArmour>\t<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label>\t\"damage reduction at max armour\"\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#damageReductionAtMaxArmour>\t<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain>\t<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#Game>\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#damageReductionAtMaxArmour>\t<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type>\t<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty>\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#maxArmourRating>\t<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment>\t\"The top of this game's armour scale.\"\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#maxArmourRating>\t<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label>\t\"max armour rating\"\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#maxArmourRating>\t<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain>\t<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#Game>\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#maxArmourRating>\t<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type>\t<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty>\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#metresPerLengthUnit>\t<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label>\t\"metres per length unit\"\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#metresPerLengthUnit>\t<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain>\t<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#Game>\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#metresPerLengthUnit>\t<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type>\t<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty>\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#maxPlayerHealth>\t<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label>\t\"max player health\"\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#maxPlayerHealth>\t<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain>\t<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#Game>\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#maxPlayerHealth>\t<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type>\t<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty>\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#refillsAtCheckpoint>\t<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment>\t\"True when the item comes back full at a checkpoint. Not every game has checkpoints.\"\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#refillsAtCheckpoint>\t<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label>\t\"refills at checkpoint\"\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#refillsAtCheckpoint>\t<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type>\t