/01/rdf-schema#comment>\t\"Length in the source game's length unit.\"\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#length>\t<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label>\t\"length\"\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#length>\t<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type>\t<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty>\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#baseDamage>\t<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment>\t\"Damage of one hit, in hit points of the source game.\"\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#baseDamage>\t<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label>\t\"base damage\"\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#baseDamage>\t<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type>\t<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty>\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#importTarget>\t<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range>\t<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#Game>\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#importTarget>\t<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment>\t\"The customs declaration: the receiving game states it, and the conversion rule reads it.\"\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#importTarget>\t<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label>\t\"import target\"\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#importTarget>\t<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type>\t<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#fromGame>\t<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range>\t<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#Game>\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#fromGame>\t<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment>\t\"The game whose units every number on this item is written in.\"\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#fromGame>\t<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label>\t\"from game\"\n<https://tesseractse